Yos7EPbPQqo7kPgtGTHK5NzvPFTfaihL9XK2-xg&oe=69AAD01E"}, "display_name": "Summer Games VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Summer Games VR offers an immersive virtual reality experience that transports players into a world of athletic prowess and competitive spirit with a variety of engaging modes, including Practice, Single Player, Tournament, and Multiplayer.\n\nThrilling Sports Lineup:\n\nArchery: Test your precision and focus as you aim for the bullseye in this classic event.\nJavelin: Master the art of the javelin throw, harnessing power and accuracy to achieve record distances.\n100m Run: Sprint against the clock and rival athletes in a heart-pounding dash for victory.\n400m Relay Race: Team up with fellow competitors in an exhilarating relay race, passing the baton with split-second timing.\nDiving: Execute graceful dives from varying heights, showcasing elegance and control.\nSwimming: Dive into the pool and power through the water, striving for new personal bests.\nBoxing: Step into the ring, where strategy and quick reflexes are essential to outsmarting your opponent.", "short_description": "Summer Games VR offers an immersive virtual reality experience that transports players into a world of athletic prowess and competitive spirit with a variety of engaging modes, including Practice, Single Player, Tournament, and Multiplayer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/9a19a826-b2f7-469e-9603-d434928e44db", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Texas Ego Films", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.texasegofilms.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "